From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruben Andersen <sterion@sterion.dk>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:19:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Pin OpenVINO 2026.3.1

The OpenVINO release Intel validates NPU driver 1.38 against. The model
converter is pinned to the same version as the runtime.
---
 docker/main/requirements-ov.txt     | 2 +-
 docker/main/requirements-wheels.txt | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docker/main/requirements-ov.txt b/docker/main/requirements-ov.txt
index 2df7890..c0dea74 100644
--- a/docker/main/requirements-ov.txt
+++ b/docker/main/requirements-ov.txt
@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@
 numpy
-openvino >= 2026.2.0
+openvino == 2026.3.1
diff --git a/docker/main/requirements-wheels.txt b/docker/main/requirements-wheels.txt
index 5ed9664..3878e86 100644
--- a/docker/main/requirements-wheels.txt
+++ b/docker/main/requirements-wheels.txt
@@ -42,7 +42,7 @@ opencv-python-headless == 4.11.0.*
 opencv-contrib-python == 4.11.0.*
 scipy == 1.16.*
 # OpenVino & ONNX
-openvino == 2025.4.*
+openvino == 2026.3.1
 onnxruntime == 1.22.*
 # Embeddings
 transformers == 4.45.*
